#~ msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "This analysis computes a survival curve for censored data using the "
#~ "Kaplan-Meier estimator for single-event survival data. It estimates the "
#~ "probability of survival over time, allowing you to understand and "
#~ "visualize the distribution of survival times within your data. The "
#~ "analysis accommodates censored observations (subjects for whom the event "
#~ "has not occurred during the study period) and enables comparison of "
#~ "survival curves across different groups using statistical tests such as "
#~ "the Log-Rank test, Peto and Peto test, and Fleming-Harrington test. "
#~ "Additionally, you can generate life tables to summarize survival data at "
#~ "specified intervals."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "本分析使用 Kaplan-Meier 估计为单事件生存数据中的删失数据计算生存曲线。它估"
#~ "计随时间推移的生存概率，帮助您理解和可视化数据中生存时间的分布。该分析可处"
#~ "理删失观测（在研究期间未发生事件的受试者），并可使用 Log-Rank 检验、Peto "
#~ "与 Peto 检验以及 Fleming-Harrington 检验等统计检验比较不同组别的生存曲线。"
#~ "此外，您还可以生成生命表，以指定间隔汇总生存数据。"

#~ msgctxt "NonParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
#~ "occurs."
#~ msgstr "选择表示事件发生或删失前时间的变量。"

